[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0000","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0010","text":"今天谢谢大家了。\n很开心──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0020","text":"好——大家辛苦了。\n也请继续多多关照！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0030","text":"──啊，阳希酱的录音是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0040","text":"嗯……\n是后天的安排！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0050","text":"后天……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0060","text":"如果行程方便的话──\n我可以去参观吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0070","text":"当然，我们这边没问题！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0080","text":"呵呵，谢谢你──！\n我确认一下再联系你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0090","text":"那么，我先告辞啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0100","text":"（“录音结束了\n　　接下来要去拍摄”）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0110","text":"（——发送）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0120","text":"──嗯，不错呢。\n好可爱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0130","text":"能再往这边看一点吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0140","text":"好，谢谢。\n真不错——羽那酱，真的很上镜！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0150","text":"怎么样？\n我觉得每张照片都很可爱，都很好。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0160","text":"……我自己不太清楚，\n但我觉得挺好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0170","text":"嗯，明白了。\n……哎呀，毕竟模特好嘛。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0180","text":"今天能拍到好照片真是太好了。\n谢谢你。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0190","text":"——啊哈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080100_02_0200","text":"您真的很会夸人呢！"}]
